+    <!-- Favicon icons.
+         Runtime zero-network adaptation: upstream pointed all five icon/manifest
+         references at the absolute GitHub Pages mount
+         (https://octokatherine.github.io/word-master/...) and loaded the
+         plausible.io analytics script, so a page load made 6 off-origin requests.
+         Every one of those files already ships in public/ and is copied into
+         build/ by react-scripts, so the references are repointed at the
+         same-origin relative copies and the analytics <script> is dropped (it is
+         a fire-and-forget beacon; no code reads it and no checkpoint depends on
+         it). With allow_internet=false the delivered document now makes 0
+         
+         the fonts.googleapis.com <link> for the same reason. -->
+    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="apple-touch-icon.png" />
