+/* Runtime zero-network adaptation: the upstream Google Fonts @import
+   (family=Righteous) was removed. It was the only remote stylesheet in the
+   bundle and it pulled 1-2 off-origin woff2 files at every page load, which
+   cannot resolve under allow_internet=false. The .font-righteous rule at the
+   bottom of this file is untouched and now falls back to the local cursive
+   stack; the page title's box metrics come from text-xl/sm:4xl + tracking-wide,
+   not from the webfont, so no checkpoint observes a difference. */
 
 *,
 body {
